WEBVTT

00:00:00.157 --> 00:00:05.878
A grid places buy orders below the price

00:00:06.128 --> 00:00:11.947
and sell orders above it. When price crosses

00:00:12.427 --> 00:00:17.846
a line, that order fills. The range is

00:00:17.896 --> 00:00:24.042
the band chosen before the start. Past that

00:00:24.532 --> 00:00:28.726
band, the grid has left its plan. A

00:00:28.726 --> 00:00:29.076
liquidation line sits beyond the range. The

00:00:29.076 --> 00:00:29.476
gap is the buffer. If the buffer shrinks,

00:00:29.476 --> 00:00:29.875
the plan is under stress. Count the fills.

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:30.175
Read the buffer. Keep the picture.
